On Tue, Sep 01, 2026, Sean Christopherson wrote:
> On Tue, Sep 01, 2026, Fuad Tabba wrote:
> > > diff --git a/virt/kvm/guest_memfd.c b/virt/kvm/guest_memfd.c
> > > index 803c7cdbbe0f6..fe02c47c85fb5 100644
